{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08355","headline":"寄弄月溪吴山人 · 李白","name":"寄弄月溪吴山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻庞德公，家住洞湖水。\n终身栖鹿门，不入襄阳市。\n夫君弄明月，灭景清淮里。\n高踪邈难追，可与古人比。\n清扬杳莫覩，白云空望美。\n待我辞人间，携手访松子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}